  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Catalyzing Comprehensive Justice Reforms: Developing Djibouti&apos;s First Justice Sector Strategy for Inclusive Growth and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Djiboutis Vision 2035 emphasizes justice sector modernization as pivotal for national development, peace, and governance. Building on achievements of the EU-funded Support to Justice Project (PAJ) implemented by UNDP (2021-2024), the Justice Reform Catalyst project lays the groundwork for comprehensive justice reforms through the development of the countrys first Justice Sector Strategy. In parallel, it will maintain the momentum of ongoing reforms with a focus on quick-impact activities and d</narrative>
  </description>
